{"sba-hinata-29462":{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":" \n \n \n \n \n こんばんは•*¨*•.¸¸♬︎\n \n 佐々木のみーぱんです！！\n \n \n \n \n \n 今日は、個別握手会に来てくださってありがとうございました😙\n \n 元気になれるとかお仕事頑張れるよ〜！って声を沢山聴けてすごく嬉しかったですﾟ･*:.｡❁\n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n みなさん、お仕事とか学校とかファイトです💪🏻💪🏻\n \n もっともっとみんなに元気を届けるぞ〜！！\n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n そしてそして今日はたくさんのお花を頂きました☺️\n うれしいな。\n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ33S94V7M89BMRJBNW8F754","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ33SA4E0HTHCRABBVX91RW4","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ33SB2QHQ0XJDQ2ED3P5J7A","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ33SC3TRX3QN34MRT87WXR6","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ33SD26G31EYK4DSVQGZ86N","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ33SE00AJAT0XCWTMVH167M","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ33SFCMR0XVBRKTGKKM4QXD","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ33SGB2Q4YWAQCCMKMF930P","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n たくさんのお花、本当に嬉しいです🥰\n \n ありがとうございます！！\n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n それじゃあまたね〜。\n \n \n \n \n \n 🍞佐々木美玲🍞"}],"source":"archive"},"crw-nogi-18232":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"AKBINGO!見てくれましたか～？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まず、ウクレレでチームKさんの歌を歌詞作って歌わせていだきました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"実は収録のときは、緊張してて一回途中で止まってしまったんです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"}